  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Thomas Johan Jessen is a Norwegian investor who built his career in the seafood group Kverva and became a shareholder in its parent, Kvarv. Educated at the Norwegian School of Economics, he later established Creos with Fredrik Platou. The Oslo investment company manages a portfolio of shares, bonds and other investments.",
    "html": "<p>Thomas Johan Jessen is a Norwegian investor who built his career in the seafood group Kverva and became a shareholder in its parent, Kvarv. Educated at the Norwegian School of Economics, he later established Creos with Fredrik Platou. The Oslo investment company manages a portfolio of shares, bonds and other investments.</p>\r\n",
